            <article class="deathARC_inner" id="deathClock_article">

                <!-- title -->
                <h2 class="about_title">
                    DISCOVER YOUR FUTURE WITH THE <br>
                    <span class="special_yellow_text">DEATH CLOCK</span>
                </h2>
    
                <!-- content -->
                <p class="about_ptag">
                    The Death Clock uses advanced AI to predict your lifespan based on your responses to various lifestyle questions. By considering factors like diet, exercise, stress, and family medical history, our algorithm provides a personalized prediction of your estimated time of death.
                </p>
                
                <p class="about_ptag">
                    Registered TerrorHub users can enjoy one prediction per day, alongside daily horoscopes and card readings. The Graveyard feature allows you to track your countdown and compare your results with others, offering a unique and engaging way to reflect on your lifestyle choices.
                </p>
    
                <p class="about_ptag">
                    Join the Graveyard, where each tombstone tells a story. Revisit your countdown, see how your time goes down, and share it with your friends. This feature is exclusive to TerrorHub users, providing a deeper insight into your personal health and longevity.
                </p>                
    
                <!-- buttons -->
